Hi all,

It's been a long time since the last release of i2c-tools (2008-11-29).
There have been no huge changes, but small changes have stacked up so I
think it would be great to have a new release distributions can pick.

So I plan to release i2c-tools 3.0.3 by the end of the month. See the
top of
  http://www.lm-sensors.org/browser/i2c-tools/trunk/CHANGES
for the list of changes. Feel free to test the latest SVN snapshot at
  http://dl.lm-sensors.org/i2c-tools/snapshots/i2c-tools-r5862-20100923.tar.bz2
and report.

